## Remove stale Neo4j deployment references

Context: The optional Neo4j Apps secret was removed from the DAB binding, but
the main app manifest still referenced the unbound resource and Makefile
inspection targets still passed the deleted bundle variable. This produced a
build-time resource-resolution error and broke bundle validation helpers.

Changes:

1. app.yaml.template
   Removed the legacy unbound `neo4j-password` resource and `NEO4J_PASSWORD`
   environment reference; Neo4j credentials remain managed through Settings.
2. Makefile
   Removed the deleted `neo4j_secret_scope` override from bundle validation and
   summary targets.
3. tests/units/settings/test_deploy_app_rename_guard.py
   Added regression contracts covering both the rendered app manifest source
   and Makefile deployment helpers.
4. changelogs/v0.8.0/benoitcayladbx_2026-08-31.log
   Recorded the clean-deployment correction and verification result.

